    "detailed_description": "This game is a suspense-filled first-person survival horror game. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs a player, you will assume the role of Eugenia, a 27-year-old woman who is an intern reporter, infiltrating an abandoned building of the OHJIN Group. <br />\r\nYou will explore the building interior, solve a variety of puzzles, and uncover hidden truths. <br />\r\nYou will need to navigate all accessible floors of the building, surviving potential dangers through intelligent decision-making. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game delivers a vibrant and tense experience with high-quality graphics and sound, testing your strategic thinking and decision-making skills.",
